                            {
                                "example_id": "86febd24-9574-47d2-a931-d41b86f3ae40",
                                "sense_id": "0024ad34-112a-324a-b083-e9e4af6f785d",
                                "text": "Anger at the system turned to anger against art. Damn that foolery too, which took, but never gave. A promise of achievement always withdrawn; an assurance of dignity and ease for ever vanishing over the skyline. The virus of communistic nihilism simmered within him, wishing to submerge all effort in an easily filled belly."
                            }
